<p>
   <lb n="1"/>// 850 śaka nu mān vraḥ śāsana dhūli vraḥ pāda dhūli
   <lb n="2"/>jeṅ vraḥ kamrateṅ Añ pre mratāñ Ācārya
   <lb n="3"/>purohita catt ne sruk laṁ Ava ................ Oy ta vraḥ
