           <div type="translation" source="bib:Chhom2011_01">
 	<p n="1-4">850 Śaka era. There was a royal order of His Majesty to Mratāñ Ācāryapurohita (the ritual priest) to establish (a village) of Lam Ava ---------- in order to offer to god of the kingdom.</p>
              <p n="4-14">Si Lakṣmībhāva 1, Si Candra ... 1, another Si Lakṣmībhāva, Si Īśvarabhāva 1, Si Sakarma 1, Si ... dāsa 1, Si Yajñadāsa 1, Si ..., Si Kaṁvat 1, Si ... 1, Si ... 1, Si ... 1, Si Śakti 1, Si Priyamvāda 1, Tai Kaṁpit 1, Tai ..., Tai Gandha 1, Tai Kaṁvai1, Tai 1, Tai ..., Tai Bhāva 1, Tai Kanses 1, Tai ... 1, Tai ... 1, Tai ..., Tai ... 1, Tai ... 1, Tai ... 1, Tai ... 1, Tai ... si pau 1, Tai ...</p>
              <p n="15-16">...</p>
              <p n="17-22">... oil 1 mās, Tai ... Tai ... Tai ... Bhāja ... Śakti ...</p>
              <p n="23-26">...</p>
